      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Day 103\n\nI'm done with this. Now I can't even write without someone trying to look over my shoulder? Some of the others have seen me write in this book and began to question me. I refused to let them see it, of course. They threatened to take it and rip it up.. I'm sick of them, and this place. I hope someone barges in here and kills them all!",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
