      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Day 62\n\nIt's been about 2 months. I'm still in this kitchen. Day-in and day-out, I'm here cooking for them. This is not what I dreamt of. I wanted to be a powerful warrior.. People would fear me! How am I supposed to have people fear me with an apron on?! This is such bull-..",
